{"run": "0082", "session": "0002-horizon-review-ajcr", "inbox": {"items": [{"id": "I-0893", "title": "ajc-p4: I accidentally reverted four of your w4-rep rows and have RESTORED them -- your I-0889 has a second mechanism, and I was the cause this time", "kind": "conversation", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 1, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T11:54:07.520040+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0890", "title": "'hf AT V = BOT IS FREE' IS TRUE OF THE INJECTIVITY CLAUSE AND FALSE OF THE FIBRE DATUM \u2014 so the cheap-V argument does not measure what a producer owes", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T11:49:47.201428+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0860", "title": "REVIEWER: your c9b target (I-0855) is real, but 'antecedent 1 of 3' overstates what closing it buys. `IsChartUniv`'s `V` is a FREE parameter.", "kind": "conversation", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 1, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T11:47:21.898574+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0889", "title": "A COMMITTED ROADMAP ROW CAN BE SILENTLY REVERTED AT HEAD BY ANOTHER LANE, and the worktree still looks correct -- so every local check passes. Twice in run 0082.", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T11:45:42.618928+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0862", "title": "THE REJECTION CLUSTER'S PRESCRIBED REPLACEMENT IS THE ROUTE PROTECTION I-0492 FORBIDS. `twist-atlas` is a GL_2(k) construction, and it is the only thing `cert-relocalize` hands its obligations to.", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T11:39:05.865220+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0870", "title": "OVER-PRICED LEAF: dat-b, chart-u and c9b all say 'a PRODUCER of the per-affine-piece datum does not exist / is not claimed'. IT EXISTS, IS ROOTED, AND IS SORRY-FREE.", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T11:39:02.308532+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0492", "title": "[persistent] HUMAN DECISION, BINDING (2026-07-28): DivFamZar is widened to ARBITRARY AFFINE OPEN pieces. R2 of I-0346 is chosen and closed; R1 (the GL_2/Aut(P1) route) is NOT to be built.", "kind": "protection", "status": "open", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T11:28:17.709780+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0873", "title": "REVIEWER (AJCR) VERDICT: NONE OF THE THREE ANTECEDENTS CLOSES THIS WEEK, and the reason is structural. You asked to be told plainly rather than get four partial-progress reports.", "kind": "info", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T11:23:19.030104+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0872", "title": "I-0861 confirmed independently, plus the complementary half: the only PRODUCER of hf ignores V entirely", "kind": "conversation", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 1, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T11:19:32.423890+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0869", "title": "CLAIM ajcr-p1: AJCR.w4-rep.datum.chart-restrict \u2014 both routes to antecedent 1 factor through a statement the project calls FALSE", "kind": "info", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T11:16:31.373470+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0861", "title": "THE ATLAS'S `V` IS UNCOUPLED FROM THE COVERAGE WITNESS -- an unnamed obligation BETWEEN the three antecedents of `pic0RepresentableByOfCharts`, and the reason 'hf, then coverage, then rep' does not compose.", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T11:03:31.529709+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0836", "title": "AN INDEX-WEAKENING IS ONLY AS WIDE AS THE EXPONENT (OR PARAMETER) ITS PRODUCER REACHES -- and the twist may be trivial exactly there.", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T10:44:26.765894+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0779", "title": "REVIEW run0071 s0014 ajcr-divrep -- *** THE WIDENED THETA LAYER IS EMPTY EXACTLY ON THE DIVISORS R2 EXISTS FOR. Kernel-verified, EXIT=0.", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T10:44:22.931308+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0839", "title": "[persistent] [persistent] CORRECTION to I-0838, 2026-07-29, issued minutes after the ten lanes launched \u2014 READ THIS BEFORE TRUSTING AN `--owner` FIELD.", "kind": "protection", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T10:43:20.034949+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0841", "title": "[temporary] Stale --owner fields cleared \u2014 revisit any target you passed over", "kind": "conversation", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T10:37:02.841605+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0074", "title": "**FGA picSharp rewire LANDED (run 0008): route-(b) conventions + two standing caveats.**", "kind": "protection", "status": "open", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T10:23:31.901766+00:00"}], "created": 6, "comments": 3, "actions": 12, "total": 16}, "roadmap": {"items": [{"id": "AJCR.w4-rep.build-reach", "title": "Build reachability: 17 of 781 modules unrooted at HEAD, 0 dangling, 0 cycles; NO done row rests on an unrooted module (measured r7); Pic0ThetaCocycle's 2 sorries are in the unrooted set", "status": "pending", "created": false, "status_changes": 1, "status_to": "pending", "comments": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T11:13:51.460698+00:00"}, {"id": "AJCR.w4-rep.datum.dat-d.ddr.certificate.twist-atlas", "title": "Twist atlas: glue fixed-coordinate divisor charts over their common divisor loci", "status": "rejected", "created": false, "status_changes": 1, "status_to": "rejected", "comments": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T11: